    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/caafd2a31160a851fbab3fb50a3416c8.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/caafd2a31160a851fbab3fb50a3416c8.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/caafd2a31160a851fbab3fb50a3416c8.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Survival Story Where Trust Is Tested</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim Pastures is a social deduction style, multiplayer survival game. Set in a nostalgic 1970s farm environment, each player takes on the role of a different seasonal worker. However, there is a threat on the farm: a serial killer or killers are hidden among the villagers, aiming to sabotage the production process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Load All Wagons Before Sunset</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/209329f2ade811e14f6617124a1f072a.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/209329f2ade811e14f6617124a1f072a.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/209329f2ade811e14f6617124a1f072a.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All orders must be completed flawlessly and loaded onto the wagons before sunset. Required production materials must be gathered from various parts of the farm \u2014 fields, greenhouses, forests, and barns \u2014 where production takes place. Racing against time, finding the right resources is critical. Who knows, you might even find a weapon that can drastically change not only the production but the course of the game...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are an Innocent Villager</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/fa65c1bd72b5a504250fa8400e77102e.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/fa65c1bd72b5a504250fa8400e77102e.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/fa65c1bd72b5a504250fa8400e77102e.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully whom to trust. Complete your production tasks without lingering too long in secluded spots. Don\u2019t neglect your defense \u2014 always keep an axe, a scythe, or perhaps a weapon with a few bullets. Remember, villagers who complete side quests can secure themselves with a single revolver.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are a Villain Ready to Sabotage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/7740b83ef90156551d7b21f50a3810c3.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/7740b83ef90156551d7b21f50a3810c3.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/7740b83ef90156551d7b21f50a3810c3.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain trust, lie, and support production if needed. Blend in without raising suspicion. If you have a partner, plan together; eliminate workers one by one or take actions that sabotage production. You can even climb the announcement tower to manipulate the entire farm. Take control of everything before the day ends... and win the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters and Powerful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a unique character. For example, if you are a doctor, you can prepare health kits; if you are a ghost, you can move invisibly for a certain period; if you are a lumberjack, you can wield your axe stronger than others; if you are a mortician, you can reveal the role of a deceased player. Many other special character abilities are included in the game. Using your character\u2019s abilities effectively will increase your chances of survival and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every day the work begins, but not everyone finishes the day.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/caafd2a31160a851fbab3fb50a3416c8.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/caafd2a31160a851fbab3fb50a3416c8.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/caafd2a31160a851fbab3fb50a3416c8.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Survival Story Where Trust Is Tested</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim Pastures is a social deduction style, multiplayer survival game. Set in a nostalgic 1970s farm environment, each player takes on the role of a different seasonal worker. However, there is a threat on the farm: a serial killer or killers are hidden among the villagers, aiming to sabotage the production process.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Load All Wagons Before Sunset</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/209329f2ade811e14f6617124a1f072a.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/209329f2ade811e14f6617124a1f072a.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/209329f2ade811e14f6617124a1f072a.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All orders must be completed flawlessly and loaded onto the wagons before sunset. Required production materials must be gathered from various parts of the farm \u2014 fields, greenhouses, forests, and barns \u2014 where production takes place. Racing against time, finding the right resources is critical. Who knows, you might even find a weapon that can drastically change not only the production but the course of the game...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are an Innocent Villager</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/fa65c1bd72b5a504250fa8400e77102e.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/fa65c1bd72b5a504250fa8400e77102e.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/fa65c1bd72b5a504250fa8400e77102e.mp4?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully whom to trust. Complete your production tasks without lingering too long in secluded spots. Don\u2019t neglect your defense \u2014 always keep an axe, a scythe, or perhaps a weapon with a few bullets. Remember, villagers who complete side quests can secure themselves with a single revolver.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Are a Villain Ready to Sabotage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/7740b83ef90156551d7b21f50a3810c3.poster.avif?t=1754043185\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/7740b83ef90156551d7b21f50a3810c3.webm?t=1754043185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/7740b83ef90